{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a0f26e3e-ed4f-8998-875e-c431532b8207",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T13:39:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. I have a ticket. Two ticket. I am not understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, parking tickets? Take your time. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wilson Brito. B-R-I-T-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Brito. Tell me what happened with the tickets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same place. Same day. Two paper on my car. One in the morning, one after. Why two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Do you remember where the car was parked? And what day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yesterday, Sunday. In front of my house. Gidley Street, one thirty-eight. The snow, it is coming. I park there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so the snow storm. Was there a parking ban on, did you see signs or hear about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ban? [pause] I am not know this word. Ban is... no park?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a snow ban. No parking on certain streets so the plows can get through. Sometimes you can get a ticket at one time and another later if the car stays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "But it is my house. My street. Still I get ticket? Two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can happen, yes. I can't undo them from here, but I can tell you where things stand. Do you have the ticket numbers in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. One moment. [pause] My daughter, she is here, she help me read. Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'm not going anywhere. Well, until about five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. She say the number start with... [crosstalk] no, I say it. Eight, four, one, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, eight four one two. And the other one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The other, eight four one three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, back to back. Both are on file, same location, same day. Each one is its own ticket, so each has its own amount."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two amount. Together is a lot for me. Is there... plan? To pay little, little, each month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A payment plan, you're asking. I don't know the details on that one. Let me put you through to someone in collections who can tell you. Or I can take your number and have them call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Collection? Is bad? I am not in trouble?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no trouble. That's just the desk that handles payment arrangements. Different name than it sounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, call me. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one eight six. Good. They'll call you back, probably today or tomorrow. And you can also ask them about the appeal, since it was your own street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appeal. Is like... I say, please, no pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "More or less, yes. You explain, they review it. They'll go over it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Oh, and my grandson, today he lose first tooth. This is the big news today. More big than ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that beats a parking ticket, no contest. Congratulations to him. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Brito."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T13:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
